            "jpName": "メジロマックイーン",
            "enName": "Mejiro McQueen",
            "jpText": "――ということですの。\nライスさん、どう思われます？",
            "enText": "…That sums it up quite nicely. \nWhat do you think, Rice?",
            "nextBlock": 2,
            "voiceIdx": 0,
            "pathId": -8423517441463572959,
            "blockIdx": 1
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ライスシャワー",
            "enName": "Rice Shower",
            "jpText": "ええと……\nいいと思う……ですわよ。",
            "enText": "Umm… I must say it sounds… quite nice.",
            "nextBlock": 3,
            "voiceIdx": 1,
            "pathId": 6819149142174265209,
            "blockIdx": 2
        },
        {
            "jpName": "メジロマックイーン",
            "enName": "Mejiro McQueen",
            "jpText": "……っ！？　あ、あの、\nライスさん、その語尾は……？",
            "enText": "U-Um, Rice… What did you… just say?",
            "nextBlock": 4,
            "voiceIdx": 2,
            "pathId": 4436345646836194333,
            "blockIdx": 3
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ライスシャワー",
            "enName": "Rice Shower",
            "jpText": "えっと、マックイーンさんの\n真似っこ……ですのよ？",
            "enText": "Um… I am simply trying to… emulate you?",
            "nextBlock": 5,
            "voiceIdx": 3,
            "pathId": -8216640413518730938,
            "blockIdx": 4
        },
        {
            "jpName": "メジロマックイーン",
            "enName": "Mejiro McQueen",
            "jpText": "……わ、私、そんな話し方ですの？\n少し、誇張されていません？",
            "enText": "D-Do I really speak in such a manner? \nSurely you must be exaggerating.",
            "nextBlock": 6,
            "voiceIdx": 4,
            "pathId": -7354653495187807744,
            "blockIdx": 5
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ライスシャワー",
            "enName": "Rice Shower",
            "jpText": "ううん。絵本のお姫さまみたいで、\nとっても素敵……だよ。",
            "enText": "No. You always speak so politely… like a \nprincess in a picture book.",
            "nextBlock": 7,
            "voiceIdx": 5,
            "pathId": -5569484021091832155,
            "blockIdx": 6
        },
        {
            "jpName": "メジロマックイーン",
            "enName": "Mejiro McQueen",
            "jpText": "……もう。そうキラキラされますと\nなにも言えなくなってしまいますわ。",
            "enText": "…Well. When you say that with such sparkling \neyes, how can I tell you to stop…",
            "nextBlock": -1,
